    "correctAnswer": "A",
    "explanation": "Explanation: [Ti(H2O)6]2+ is d2: CFSE = 2 * (-0.4) = -0.8 delta_o (A-IV). [V(H2O)6]2+ is d3: CFSE = 3 * (-0.4) = -1.2 delta_o (B-I). [Mn(H2O)6]3+ is d4 high-spin: CFSE = 3 * (-0.4) + 1 * (0.6) = -0.6 delta_o (C-II). [Fe(H2O)6]3+ is d5 high-spin: CFSE = 3 * (-0.4) + 2 * (0.6) = 0.0 delta_o (D-III). Matching is A-IV, B-I, C-II, D-III, which is option A.",
